CompleteMenu_75607=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Procuring Materials</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >(can be submitted)</font>
accept_75601_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >You seem a bit anxious, why don't you go to the meditation room to calm down first?</font>
accept_75602_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >There have been a lot of wolves on the mountain recently, and the people in the village are afraid to go up the mountain. Can you go and deal with it?</font>
accept_75603_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >The mud we use in the village is a special type from the riverbank here. Can you help me collect some?</font>
accept_75604_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Don't be fooled by the small size of our village, we have many hidden masters here.</font>
accept_75605_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Everyone in this village is well-versed in chess. To stay here, you need to have a wealth of knowledge about chess. Do you have it?</font>
accept_75606_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >We are running low on food and supplies,</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >and I I can't </font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >handle it all by myself...</font>
accept_75607_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >As you can see, the population of our village is growing and we are using up our resources faster. I can't handle it all by myself. Can you help me by purchasing some supplies?</font>
accept_75641_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >We have an unparalleled master in our village.</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Oh.</font>
accept_75642_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Different chess pieces represent different people.</font>
complete_75601=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Have you calmed your mind?</font>
complete_75602=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Thank you for your help, young hero!</font>
complete_75603=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >It's great, these muds came just in time, I've</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >smoothed out all my chess pieces.</font>
complete_75604=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >I didn't expect you to be so skilled</font>
complete_75605=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Impressive, you got all the answers right</font>
complete_75606=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Your help is greatly appreciated....</font>
complete_75607=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >This matter has been handled very well.</font>
complete_75641=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >You defeated Ruan Xingyuan. Your strength must be very strong</font>
complete_75642=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >This is your reward</font>
context_75601=Go to the meditation room and use the cushion to meditate
context_75602=Recently, there have been many wolves on the mountain, and the people in the village are afraid to go up the mountain.
context_75603=The people in our village love to play chess, which consumes a lot of chess pieces.
context_75604=Practice with the masters in the village
context_75605=Answer Ashiyue's questions
context_75606=If Ashiyue is in trouble, go help her.
context_75607=Ashiyue would like to ask for your help in purchasing some items to supplement the shortage in the village.
context_75641=Challenge <a href="findnpc_new,groupscene045,NPC_2020jq_dingzw003" style="HLStype1">Ruan Xingyuan</a>
context_75642=The key to playing chess lies in daily practice and sparring with other players.
menu_75601_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Yes, I'll do it now.</font>
menu_75602_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Yes, I am ready.</font>
menu_75603_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Okay, I'll go right away</font>
menu_75604_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >I'll go find them now!</font>
menu_75605_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Of course,</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >please</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >ask</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >whatever you want</font>
menu_75606_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Ashi</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >yue</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >don't worry, I'll help you</font>
menu_75607_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff">I go now!</font>
menu_75641_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Where is he? I'll go visit him now</font>
menu_75642_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Really?</font>
submit_75601=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >My heart has already calmed down.</font>
submit_75602=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" > Don't mention it. </font>
submit_75603=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >You're welcome!</font>
submit_75604=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >You're welcome, you're welcome</font>
submit_75605=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff">Haha.</font>
submit_75606=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Fulfill the task.</font>
submit_75607=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >You are too kind.</font>
submit_75641=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Fortunately, fortunately</font>
submit_75642=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Thank you!</font>
